{"id":"660196","name":"贝贝南瓜排骨粉签煲","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660196/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"贝贝南瓜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"惠来粉签","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨切块冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净备用。","img":"images/660196/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片炒香。","img":"images/660196/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入排骨炒香。","img":"images/660196/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽。","img":"images/660196/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味。","img":"images/660196/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/660196/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"排骨转入高压锅中小火压10分钟即可。","img":"images/660196/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"惠来粉签清水泡软。","img":"images/660196/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"贝贝南瓜洗净去籽切块。","img":"images/660196/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"排骨转个锅，放入贝贝南瓜煮至断生。","img":"images/660196/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入粉签。","img":"images/660196/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"大火煮开后再少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/660196/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"适量葱花增香。","img":"images/660196/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660196/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660196/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660196/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}